            <h3>Why Should I Join ROBLOX?</h3>
            <ul id="MembershipBenefits">
                <li id="SignupBenefit_OwnPlace">Get your very own ROBLOX place. Build whatever you want!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_GetTix">Get a daily ticket login bonus and earn tickets when people visit your place!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_BuyStuff">Use your new wealth to shop for gear in the Catalog!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_CustomizeGuy">Customize the look of your ROBLOXian!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Username">Get your own user name - grab your favorite handle before someone else does!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Forums">Post in the forums!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Stats">Track your in-game stats!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Comments">Post comments, mark favorites, and share your own creations!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Badges">Earn badges for achievements!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_Friends">Add users to your friends list!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_WeRock">Join a vibrant community of very creative people working to create their own online worlds!</li>
                <li id="SignupBenefit_OhYeahItsFree">Did I mention this is all <b>FREE?!</b></li>
            </ul>
            <p>Product requires Windows XP or better.</p>
